<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Deepika Thapar Singh — Dee</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      --sage: #c8845a;
      --deep-green: #8b3a2a;
      --forest: #5c2318;
      --earth: #c4973a;
      --warm-sand: #faf0e0;
      --cream: #fffbf4;
      --bark: #a0522d;
      --mist: #f5e6d3;
      --text: #2e2a22;
      --text-light: #6b6358;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--text);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1.2rem 4rem;
      background: rgba(250,246,238,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(122,158,126,0.2);
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--forest);
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--deep-green); }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-left {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 8rem 4rem 4rem 6rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--earth);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.2s forwards;
    }
    .hero-name {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--forest);
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.4s forwards;
    }
    .hero-name em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--earth);
    }
    .hero-tagline {
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-light);
      max-width: 420px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.6s forwards;
    }
    .hero-cta {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.8s forwards;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--deep-green);
      color: var(--cream);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--forest); }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--deep-green);
      border: 1px solid var(--deep-green);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--mist); }

    .hero-right {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: var(--mist);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-bg-pattern {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(122,158,126,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 70%, rgba(160,120,90,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
    }
    .hero-illustration {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease 1s forwards;
    }
    .hero-circle {
      width: 300px; height: 300px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sage) 0%, var(--deep-green) 100%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(61,90,64,0.25);
    }
    .hero-circle::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: -12px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(122,158,126,0.3);
    }
    .hero-circle::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: -24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(122,158,126,0.15);
    }
    .hero-initials {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 5rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .hero-tags {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .tag {
      background: white;
      color: var(--deep-green);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      border: 1px solid rgba(122,158,126,0.3);
    }

    /* ── SECTIONS SHARED ── */
    section { padding: 6rem 6rem; }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--earth);
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--forest);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .divider {
      width: 50px; height: 2px;
      background: var(--sage);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    /* ── ABOUT ── */
    #about {
      background: white;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .about-text p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .about-text p strong {
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .about-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: var(--mist);
      padding: 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
    }
    .stat-number {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--deep-green);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* ── INTERESTS ── */
    #interests { background: var(--warm-sand); }
    .interests-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .interest-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 2.2rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .interest-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(61,90,64,0.12);
    }
    .interest-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--sage), var(--earth));
    }
    .interest-icon {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .interest-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--forest);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .interest-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text-light);
    }

    /* ── TRAVEL ── */
    #travel { background: var(--forest); color: white; }
    #travel .section-title { color: var(--warm-sand); }
    #travel .section-label { color: var(--sage); }
    #travel .divider { background: var(--earth); }
    .travel-intro {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .travel-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .travel-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .travel-card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .travel-flag { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .travel-place {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--warm-sand);
    }
    .travel-note {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    /* ── BOOKSHELF ── */
    #books { background: var(--cream); }
    .books-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
      gap: 5rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .books-quote {
      background: var(--mist);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--sage);
      position: sticky;
      top: 6rem;
    }
    .books-quote blockquote {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--forest);
    }
    .books-quote cite {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--earth);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-style: normal;
    }
    .booklist { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; }
    .book-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(122,158,126,0.15);
      transition: border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .book-item:hover { border-color: var(--sage); }
    .book-spine {
      width: 8px;
      min-height: 60px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .book-info h4 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--forest);
    }
    .book-info .book-author {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--earth);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .book-info .book-note {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── MUSIC ── */
    #music { background: var(--mist); }
    .music-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .music-text p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .music-genres {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.7rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .genre-tag {
      background: var(--deep-green);
      color: white;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .music-visual {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.2rem;
    }
    .vinyl {
      width: 200px; height: 200px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: conic-gradient(
        var(--forest) 0deg, var(--deep-green) 45deg,
        var(--sage) 90deg, var(--deep-green) 135deg,
        var(--forest) 180deg, var(--bark) 225deg,
        var(--earth) 270deg, var(--bark) 315deg,
        var(--forest) 360deg
      );
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      animation: spin 20s linear infinite;
    }
    .vinyl-center {
      width: 60px; height: 60px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--cream);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .vinyl-dot {
      width: 10px; height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--earth);
    }
    @keyframes spin { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

    /* ── PHILOSOPHY ── */
    #philosophy {
      background: var(--deep-green);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 7rem 6rem;
    }
    #philosophy .section-label { color: var(--sage); text-align: center; }
    #philosophy .section-title { color: var(--warm-sand); }
    #philosophy .divider { margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
    .philosophy-quote {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: white;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .philosophy-author {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sage);
    }
    .philosophy-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    /* ── CONNECT ── */
    #connect {
      background: var(--warm-sand);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6rem;
    }
    #connect .divider { margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
    .connect-text {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-light);
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    }
    .connect-email {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--deep-green);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sage);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .connect-email:hover { color: var(--forest); }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--forest);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    footer span { color: var(--sage); }

    /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      /* NAV */
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
      .nav-links a { font-size: 0.68rem; }

      /* HERO */
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; }
      .hero-left { padding: 7rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
      .hero-right { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
      .hero-circle { width: 200px; height: 200px; }
      .hero-initials { font-size: 3.5rem; }

      /* SECTIONS */
      section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }

      /* ABOUT */
      #about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
      .about-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

      /* INTERESTS */
      .interests-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      /* TRAVEL */
      .travel-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

      /* BOOKS */
      .books-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
      .books-quote { position: static; }

      /* MUSIC */
      .music-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .music-visual { display: none; }

      /* PHILOSOPHY */
      #philosophy { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .philosophy-quote { font-size: 1.3rem; }

      /* FAMILY & FRIENDS & WORK & LEARNING */
      #family > div,
      #friends > div,
      #work > div,
      #learning > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 2rem !important; }

      /* CONNECT */
      #connect { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .connect-email { font-size: 1.1rem; }

      /* ALL INLINE GRIDS */
      div[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr"],
      div[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr"],
      div[style*="grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr"],
      div[style*="grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr"],
      div[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:"] {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
        gap: 1.5rem !important;
      }

      /* STAT CARDS */
      .stat-number { font-size: 2rem; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .nav-links { gap: 0.5rem; }
      .nav-links a { font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
      .hero-name { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .section-title { font-size: 1.8rem; }
      .travel-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-tags { gap: 0.4rem; }
      .tag { font-size: 0.65rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">Dee</div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#interests">Interests</a></li>
    <li><a href="#travel">Travel</a></li>
    <li><a href="#books">Books</a></li>
    <li><a href="#music">Music</a></li>
    <li><a href="#family">Family</a></li>
    <li><a href="#friends">Friends</a></li>
    <li><a href="#learning">Learning</a></li>
    <li><a href="#connect">Connect</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Welcome to my corner of the world</p>
    <h1 class="hero-name">Deepika<br>Thapar Singh<br><em>— Dee</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">
      Educator. Explorer. People's person. My heart lives between the golden streets of Dubai and the misty mountains of India — and everywhere books, music, and good people take me.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#about" class="btn btn-primary">Discover My World</a>
      <a href="#connect" class="btn btn-outline">Say Hello</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="hero-bg-pattern"></div>
    <div class="hero-illustration">
      <div class="hero-circle" style="overflow:hidden; padding:0;">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%;" alt="Dee and Bikram"/>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-tags">
        <span class="tag">🏔️ Mountains</span>
        <span class="tag">📚 Books</span>
        <span class="tag">🎵 Music</span>
        <span class="tag">✈️ Travel</span>
        <span class="tag">🤖 AI & Tech</span>
        <span class="tag">🌏 Dubai</span>
        <span class="tag">📸 @Dee_singh_abundance</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="about-text">
    <p class="section-label">My Story</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">A People's Person at Heart</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>
      I'm <strong>Dee</strong> — a school principal based in the vibrant city of Dubai, deeply rooted in the world of K–12 CBSE education. With over <strong>36 years</strong> in this field, education isn't just my profession — it's my calling.
    </p>
    <p>
      What truly lights me up is <strong>people</strong>. I am, at my core, someone who thrives on human connection — meeting new faces, hearing stories, and building communities. I believe every person carries a universe worth exploring.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am deeply <strong>family-oriented</strong> — my husband <strong>Bikram</strong> and I have built a life full of love, laughter and adventure. We are proud parents of two wonderful sons, <strong>Anant</strong> and <strong>Kabeer</strong>. Anant's wife <strong>Deirdra</strong> is, quite simply, the daughter we never had — and our family feels beautifully complete with her in it. Our home is also lovingly ruled by our three dogs! 🐾
    </p>
  </div>
    <div class="about-stats">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">36</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Years in Education</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">4</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Beloved Family — Bikram, Anant, Kabeer & Deirdra</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">3</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Dogs — My Fur Babies 🐾</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">🌏</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Based in Dubai, UAE</div>
