<!-- FAMILY -->
<section id="family" style="background: var(--warm-sand); padding: 6rem;">
  <p class="section-label">My Greatest Blessing</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Family — The Roots That Hold Me</h2>
  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: start;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:1.2rem;">
        Family is everything to me. My <strong>mother</strong>, my <strong>sisters and brothers</strong>, my <strong>sisters-in-law and brothers-in-law</strong>, and our beautiful extended family — each one holds a very special, irreplaceable place in my heart and in my life.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:1.2rem;">
        We are bound not just by blood, but by love, laughter, shared memories, and an unspoken understanding that we are always there for each other. Our family circles — lovingly called <strong><em>'Dil ki Baat'</em></strong> and <strong><em>'Khandaan'</em></strong> — are where I find my truest sense of belonging, warmth, and joy.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:1.2rem;">
        And then there is <strong>Papa</strong>. I miss him deeply — every single day. But I also know, with every fibre of my being, that he is my <strong>guardian angel</strong>, gently guiding me, watching over me, and walking beside me in every step I take. His love never left. It simply changed form.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light);">
        I hold deep <strong>gratitude</strong> for all my ancestors and for every beloved family member who is now with the Divine. You shaped us. You loved us. Your light lives on in everything we are and everything we do. 🙏
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.2rem;">
      <div style="background:white; padding:1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid var(--sage);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">❤️</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--forest); font-weight:400;">Dil ki Baat</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-top:0.3rem; line-height:1.7;">Our family circle where every heart speaks freely and every bond runs deep.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:white; padding:1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid var(--earth);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">🏡</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--forest); font-weight:400;">Khandaan</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-top:0.3rem; line-height:1.7;">Our extended family — a tapestry of love, tradition, and togetherness woven across generations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:white; padding:1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid var(--sage);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">🌟</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--forest); font-weight:400;">Papa — My Guardian Angel</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-top:0.3rem; line-height:1.7;">No longer beside me, but never far. Guiding me, loving me, watching over me — always.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Gratitude tribute -->
  <div style="margin-top:3rem; background:var(--forest); border-radius:4px; padding:2.5rem; text-align:center;">
    <p style="font-size:0.72rem; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--sage); margin-bottom:1rem;">A Tribute of Gratitude</p>
    <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.5rem; font-style:italic; font-weight:300; color:white; line-height:1.6; max-width:700px; margin:0 auto;">
      "To all my ancestors and beloved family members who are now with the Divine — thank you. Your love, your sacrifices, and your light are woven into the very fabric of who I am. I carry you with me, always."
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:1.5rem;">🙏</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FRIENDS -->
<section id="friends" style="background: white; padding: 6rem;">
  <p class="section-label">My Tribe</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Friends — My Chosen Family</h2>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:1.2rem;">
        I am truly fortunate. Some of my friendships go all the way back to <strong>Grade 4</strong> — those rare, golden bonds that have quietly stood the test of time, distance, and life's many chapters. Some friends have been there from the very beginning. Others I have met along the way. And each one holds a very, very special place in my heart.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:1.2rem;">
        We may not speak every day. Life gets busy, cities change, continents shift. But there is a quiet knowing — a certainty — that they are simply <strong>there</strong>. That kind of friendship needs no maintenance. It just <em>is</em>. And that, to me, is the most beautiful thing.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:300; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-light);">
        I have my constants — friends who have walked with me through every storm and every celebration, who know my story without needing it explained. I am who I am because of the beautiful souls I have been lucky enough to call my friends. Life is infinitely richer because of them.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.2rem;">
      <div style="background: var(--mist); padding: 1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">🤝</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--forest); font-weight:400;">Loyalty</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-top:0.3rem; line-height:1.6;">Friends who show up — always, without question</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--mist); padding: 1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left: 3px solid var(--earth);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">😂</div>
