      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--mist); padding: 1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">🌍</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--forest); font-weight:400;">Across Miles</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-top:0.3rem; line-height:1.6;">Distance never dimmed a single friendship</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--mist); padding: 1.8rem; border-radius:4px; border-left: 3px solid var(--earth);">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">💚</div>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--forest); font-weight:400;">Soul Deep</p>
